</div></div></div></div></div> <div class="col col-5-12 grid-4-12"><div class="block block-box box box--default box-inherit-color" id="gopass"><div class="row"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-image"><div class="image image-mask ratio-original" style="padding-bottom:100%"><img alt="Logo GOPASS" decoding="async" loading="lazy" src="/files/napojeni-gopass.svg"/></div></div></div></div>
